## UC7 — Transaction Reporting: Postman Testing Guide

Start the server (`bun run dev`) then hit the **Admin API**.

### Query 1 — Search transactions by date range
```graphql
# POST http://localhost:3000/admin-api
query {
    paypalTransactions(input: {
        startDate: "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
        endDate: "2024-01-31T23:59:59Z"
        transactionStatus: "S"     # S=Success (optional)
        transactionCurrency: "USD" # optional
        pageSize: 20
        page: 1
    }) {
        totalItems
        totalPages
        page
        transactions {
            transactionId
            transactionEventCode
            transactionInitiationDate
            transactionStatus
            transactionAmount { value currencyCode }
            feeAmount { value currencyCode }
            payerEmail
            payerName
            invoiceId
        }
    }
}
```

### Query 2 — Fetch account balances
```graphql
query {
    paypalBalances {
        currency
        primary
        totalBalance { value currencyCode }
        availableBalance { value currencyCode }
        withheldBalance { value currencyCode }
    }
}
```

> **Note:** PayPal's sandbox transaction history takes up to 3 hours to appear. If the sandbox account is fresh, use a broad date range covering when you ran the UC1–UC5 tests.

Let me know when you're ready for UC8!

